{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/e5d266a5968033658b057756bf0baf94.poster.avif?t=1771855990\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/e5d266a5968033658b057756bf0baf94.webm?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/e5d266a5968033658b057756bf0baf94.mp4?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Secrets</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your cunning to unravel the mysteries of Landremi. Explore labyrinths, decipher enigmas, and discover hidden chambers full of secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating Narrative</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rich story full of twists and turns. Encounter memorable characters, make important decisions, and shape Enoah's destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be enchanted by incredible 3D graphics. Every scenario has been crafted with attention to detail to offer an impressive visual immersion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electrifying Gameplay</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense action and challenging puzzles combine with fluid controls for a fun and engaging experience from beginning to end. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable Experience</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into unique and emotional moments that will mark your journey \u2014 and your memory \u2014 for a long time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/2315afc75984101bec9a9e8fbac18324.poster.avif?t=1771855990\" width=618 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/2315afc75984101bec9a9e8fbac18324.webm?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/2315afc75984101bec9a9e8fbac18324.mp4?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure through mysterious territories, discover forgotten paths, and unravel the hidden secrets of an ancient world. Every corner hides a surprise, every detour can reveal a new story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/c8550e95da45a5bec4c3f16bdbadb3df.poster.avif?t=1771855990\" width=618 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/c8550e95da45a5bec4c3f16bdbadb3df.webm?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/c8550e95da45a5bec4c3f16bdbadb3df.mp4?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face formidable creatures in intense and strategic battles. Master your weapons, learn to read your enemies, and experience epic confrontations where every victory brings Enoah closer to his goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/187331a313b807d10928cab483f2c902.poster.avif?t=1771855990\" width=618 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/187331a313b807d10928cab483f2c902.webm?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/187331a313b807d10928cab483f2c902.mp4?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your intelligence by solving complex enigmas and ancestral mechanisms. Use your ingenuity to open secret doors, activate artifacts, and progress on your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND... FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/f286862b3ad1a1665c71ce5d317066ef.poster.avif?t=1771855990\" width=618 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/f286862b3ad1a1665c71ce5d317066ef.webm?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/extras/f286862b3ad1a1665c71ce5d317066ef.mp4?t=1771855990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to embark on an unforgettable journey. Add to your wishlist and come discover Enoah's destiny.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2981630?t=1771855990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2981630?t=1771855990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/69ed69a6d37c73649753904bea71a6c38a4639ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771855990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981630/69ed69a6d37c73649753904bea71